-scenario-event","line":25},{"title":"Add a scenario event","target":"add-a-scenario-event","line":29},{"title":"Add a participant and monitor the responses","target":"add-a-participant-to-the-scenario-event","line":30},{"title":"Scenario analysis","target":"scenario-analysis-ov","line":31},{"title":"Operational Resilience","target":"grc-opres-landing-page","line":32}],"metadata":{"title":"Adding a scenario event to the analysis","description":"You can add a scenario event to the scenario analysis and analyze its impact on your business service. If you are the scenario analysis owner, you can add the stakeholders and reviewers to the scenario analysis in Operational Resilience Workspace. You can then collate the observations of all participants and use their inputs to analyze the scenario.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/governance-risk-compliance/add-scenario-event.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":1,"breadcrumb":["Enable the legacy scenario analysis flow","Legacy scenario analysis","Scenario analysis","Manage","Operational Resilience","Governance","Risk","and Compliance"],"tags":["#governance-risk-compliance","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/governance-risk-compliance/add-scenario-event.md"},
